\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces CartPole-v1 rule-constrained arm, eight seeds, $\tau _c=0.70$. Left: held-out coverage of the induced rule bank. Right: action agreement between the bank and the learned policy on covered states. Each line is one seed; hollow markers are the audit-only arm and filled markers the constrained arm. Every arm is measured on its own state occupancy, so this is a same-seed pairing, not a matched-state comparison. Coverage rises in $8/8$ seeds and agreement falls in $8/8$ seeds: the mask does not reduce the reach of the rule bank, it removes the policy's ability to disagree with it.}}{16}{figure.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:constraint-coverage}{{3}{16}{CartPole-v1 rule-constrained arm, eight seeds, $\tau _c=0.70$. Left: held-out coverage of the induced rule bank. Right: action agreement between the bank and the learned policy on covered states. Each line is one seed; hollow markers are the audit-only arm and filled markers the constrained arm. Every arm is measured on its own state occupancy, so this is a same-seed pairing, not a matched-state comparison. Coverage rises in $8/8$ seeds and agreement falls in $8/8$ seeds: the mask does not reduce the reach of the rule bank, it removes the policy's ability to disagree with it}{figure.caption.11}{}}
